<title>FRANCE: University teachers strike in Algiers.</title>
<headline>University teachers strike in Algiers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>University teachers on Wednesday went on strike for a second day in Algiers to back demands for more pay and housing benefits, Algerian radio said.</p>
<p>It said the strike was reasonably well supported in the Algerian capital's five main universities.</p>
</text>
